Composite API with `allOrNone` provides one call, sequential execution in the given order, and rollback of all subrequests on failure. The Asset can reference the not-yet-returned Account Id via `@{newAccount.id}`, and is inserted—and thus queryable by the `Service_Request__c` trigger in the same transaction—before the service request.

```http
POST /services/data/v60.0/composite HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "allOrNone": true,
  "compositeRequest": [
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "/services/data/v60.0/sobjects/Account",
      "referenceId": "newAccount",
      "body": {
        "Name": "Hollis Outdoor Supply"
